{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And it shall be.</b> The meaning: at the arrival of this time." "<b>And she shall return to her hire.</b> Like אתנן זונה (Deuteronomy 23:19) — payment for prostitution." "<b>And she shall prostitute herself with all the kingdoms.</b> The meaning: that they shall come to her to trade."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:49.705681418Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}